MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

PEAK.md lists every Lv. 100 peak team with real stats, their attack
types, team weaknesses and suggested counters. TYPES.md has the Gen 3
type chart, the moves whose category changed with the split, and every
move with its effect. Pokédex pages mention the ability coach.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
